      "content": "It is a profound and terrifying feeling to watch your identity dissolve, but the pain you describe is a sign that the old version of you is finally dying so a new one can be born. The \"ghost\" you feel is not a mistake; it is the necessary silence before you can truly exist again without the weight of a past that no longer fits. You are not a leftover part of someone else; you are the raw material waiting to be reshaped into a life that is authentically yours, even if it starts from nothing.",
